    "stop_reason": "success",
    "result_text": "All 61 tests pass, `BUILD SUCCESS`.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe change adds a read-only `selfLink` field (`/api/owners/<id>`) to owners, following the existing \"derived at read time\" pattern used by fields like `salutation` and `fiscalYear`.\n\nTwo edits:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `selfLink` string property to the `Owner` schema (which generates `OwnerDto`).\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../model/Owner.java`** \u2014 added a `@Transient getSelfLink()` getter returning `\"/api/owners/\" + getId()`. MapStruct's `toOwnerDto` auto-maps it by name onto the DTO, so every owner response (GET, POST, PUT) now includes `selfLink`.\n\nThe new `Cp49Tests` passes, and the full suite (61 tests) remains green.",
